index=entra (sourcetype="azure:loganalytics:signinlogs" OR sourcetype="azure:loganalytics:aadnoninteractiveusersigninlogs") earliest=-1h latest=now
``` ========================================================================== ```
``` Detection (SPL): Contoso ITDR - Password spray across one network (distinct users per ASN) ```
``` Lab:             Contoso Health Identity Platform - Splunk second SIEM     ```
``` KQL twin:        lab/kql/failed-signin-spray-by-asn.kql ```
``` -------------------------------------------------------------------------- ```
``` STAND-IN: Splunk Enterprise 60-day TRIAL. Written 2026-11-07 with the     ```
``` fourth ITDR set (review findings B1, B2, C5, D1).                         ```
``` | eval Asn=AutonomousSystemNumber ```
``` | where isnotnull(Asn) AND Asn!="" ```
``` | lookup contoso_trusted_asns.csv asn AS Asn OUTPUT asn AS TrustedAsn ```
``` | where isnull(TrustedAsn) ```
``` | eval Fail=if(in(ResultType, "50126", "50053", "50055", "50056", "50057", "50034"), 1, 0), Ok=if(ResultType=="0", 1, 0) ```
``` | stats sum(Fail) AS Tries, sum(Ok) AS Oks, values(IPAddress) AS Ips BY Asn, UserPrincipalName ```
``` | eventstats dc(eval(if(Tries>0 AND Tries<=3, UserPrincipalName, null()))) AS DistinctUsers BY Asn ```
``` | where DistinctUsers >= 10 ```
``` | eval SprayUser=if(Tries>0 AND Tries<=3, UserPrincipalName, null()), Hit=if(Tries>0 AND Tries<=3 AND Oks>0, UserPrincipalName, null()) ```
``` | stats values(SprayUser) AS Users, values(Hit) AS Compromised, sum(eval(if(Tries<=3, Tries, 0))) AS FailedCount, values(Ips) AS Ips, first(DistinctUsers) AS DistinctUsers BY Asn ```
``` | eval Severity=if(mvcount(Compromised) > 0, "High", "Medium"), TimeGenerated=strftime(now(), "%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%S%z") ```
``` | table TimeGenerated, Severity, Asn, DistinctUsers, FailedCount, Users, Compromised, Ips ```
``` ========================================================================== ```
``` @stanza Contoso ITDR - Password spray across one network (distinct users per ASN) ```
